  "details": "Hello VRChat Team!\n\nI would like to request support for Meta Quest's Multimodal Input feature.\n\nI use a Meta Quest 3S standalone headset, and I would love to play VRChat using:\n\nRight controller for movement and menu controls.\n\nLeft hand tracking for natural hand and finger movements.\n\nGames like Banners & Bastions already support using one controller and one tracked hand simultaneously.\n\nCould you please add this feature to VRChat's standalone Quest version?\n\nI think this would make VRChat much more accessible and enjoyable!\n\nThank you!",
